# This project does not require environment variables for the first version.
# Add future service keys here only after the related feature is configured.

# --- Photographer Network membership (Stripe) ---------------------------------
# Real, live Stripe values -- already set in the live Vercel project for
# the two price id variables. Read from lib/photographer_membership_config.mjs
# (price ids) and directly from process.env at the point of use (secret
# key/webhook secret, server-only, never re-exported anywhere a browser
# script could reach them). Names only below -- never a real value.
# See docs/DECISIONS.md's "Real Stripe Integration" entries for exactly
# what each one is for.
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
# STRIPE_PHOTOGRAPHER_MONTHLY_PRICE_ID=
# STRIPE_PHOTOGRAPHER_ANNUAL_PRICE_ID=
